# Desperate Measures may target any creature, but "dies under your control" is Bot1's: Bot2's Memnite becomes 2/0 and dies under
# Bot2's control, so Bot1 draws nothing (it is not like A Good Day to Die, which draws whoever's creature it was).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Jet
Desperate Measures
Island x5
Forest x10

[Bot2 Deck]
Memnite
Island x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Memnite.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot1.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Desperate Measures.Cast(Bot2.Battlefield.Memnite)
Bot1.Pass
Bot2.Pass

[Expect]
Bot2.Graveyard = Memnite
Bot1.Hand.Count = 6
